x1 is a predicate relationship with relation x2 among arguments x3
The x2 is the relation, which is where selbri comes from: sb1=3Db2 is the r=
elation of predicate relationship sb2=3Db1 among arguments sb3=3Db3 (Note: =
bN is the place in the def. of bridi, sbN is the place in the def. of selbr=
i).
